This repository contains structured metadata, field mappings, and tooling for
tax forms filed alongside business-entity, real-estate, and probate matters. It
does not redistribute the blank forms themselves.

The blank forms are fetched on demand from their official sources:

- Maine forms (form ids prefixed "MRS-" and "ME-") are public records of
  Maine Revenue Services (https://www.maine.gov/revenue). They are fetched from
  maine.gov and verified against catalog/pdf_manifest.json.

- Federal forms (form ids prefixed "IRS-") are works of the United States
  Government and are in the public domain (17 U.S.C. § 105). They are fetched
  from https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf and verified against the manifest.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Maine Revenue
Services or the Internal Revenue Service. Filled output is a draft and is not
tax or legal advice; verify every form against the official source before filing.
